        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BDS450, Modern Style Door Bumper</b>\r\n<p>\r\nNot only does this Solid Brass Contemporary Door Stop look great, it is very versatility.  For commercial or residential doors. It is easy to install, by screwing onto the baseboard casement or door bottom and will protect your door, wall, and knob / lever sets. It is made of solid brass and includes both gray and white rubber tips for your decor. Available in 11 different finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BDS450-specifications.gif?v=1704354504\" width\"600\" height=\"224\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Modern Baseboard Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the  Deltana BDS450 Contemporary Baseboard Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/rubber-replacement-tip-for-contemporary-door-stop-deltana-bds450-repl-tip\"><b>Rubber Bumper Tips</b></a>: White and Gray Tips included</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BDS450.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BDS450 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
