                "title": "Solid Brass Contemporary Door Stop",
                "description": "Modern Style Door Bumper Deltana BDS450 - Not only does this Solid Brass Contemporary Door Stop look great, it is very versatility.  For commercial or residential doors. It is easy to install, by screwing onto the baseboard casement or door bottom and will protect your door, wall, and knob / lever sets. It is made of solid brass and includes both gray and white rubber tips for your decor. Available in 11 different finishes. ",
